  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 26 as printed (明治42-昭和9); 〃 expanded in year labels. Left page (p.4: 商業及銀行) and right page (p.5: 金融・貿易) joined by year row.",
   "Col 拂込資本金又ハ出資額 外地: 明治44 prints a small '朝鮮' before 15,910 and 〃 (ditto) before 大正1-6 figures — kept in the cell.",
   "'年度' is printed above the first figures of 内國郵便爲替振出 and 郵便貯金預入 and 振替貯金受入 (written '(年度)' in column names).",
   "Col 振替貯金受入, row 大正9: last digit unclear (reads 1,176,25_ , 3/9) — [?].",
   "Col 貿易 輸出, row 大正5: middle digit smudged (1,127,4_8) — [?].",
   "Row 昭和2 普通貸付 prints 977,974 (neighbours are 10-million figures) — kept as printed, apparent misprint.",
   "Col 郵便貯金預入 明治43 prints 14,574 (neighbours 104,762 and 151,498) — kept as printed.",
   "Last row 昭和9: most columns '…'; 通貨流通高 1,804,460, 手形交換高 64,194,422, 輸出 2,171,925, 輸入 2,282,531 are figures.",
   "No totals printed; none to check. 簡易保險 '—' = printed dash."
